  "aiContextParagraph": "Following the resignation of the former vice president, President Prabowo Subianto has prioritized the selection of a successor as he returns from international travel to Manila and Shenzhen. The President has indicated that he will seek guidance in his final decision-making process. Political coalitions have been invited to propose candidates, with reports noting that some entities have already begun circulating names. While major political parties have stated that final decisions on their involvement remain under the authority of party leadership, other legislative bodies like the Regional Representative Council have expressed support for the transition process. As the government works to fill the vacancy, the President has emphasized the urgency of the matter, citing a lack of time for delay. The ongoing discussion continues to involve various political figures whose names have emerged in public discourse regarding the upcoming appointment.",
